  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Find the mutual inductance in the arrangement, when a small circular loop of wire of radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;is placed inside a large square loop of wire of side <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>&#8811;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>)</mo></math>. The loops are coplanar and their centres coincide :</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ac83f3be-97d0-4516-98b9-900c9c981097-9894865.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 327px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
